      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Carlos Alberto Rosales Mendoza (12 February 1963 – 27 December 2015) was a former Mexican drug lord who founded and led an organized crime syndicate called La Familia Michoacana. He was a close friend and associate of Osiel Cárdenas Guillén, the former leader of the Gulf Cartel.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999975091689,
