    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_1",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Rafael Cárdenas Vela (a.k.a. \"El Junior\") is a former Mexican drug lord and high-ranking lieutenant of the Gulf Cartel. He is the nephew of Antonio and Osiel Cárdenas Guillén, two men who at one time led the criminal organization.",
